  "details": "Looks like it only triggers the action after the UI animation ends, rather than before the UI animation begins. If the UI animation didn't finish before closing the menu, then there's no action.\n\n1. Have someone send you a request/invite.\n\n2. Accept the request/invite.\n\n3. Quickly thereafter, close the menu. (There's a pretty big window on this, upwards to roughly half a second, almost the length of the UI animation upon accepting)\n\n4. Open up your menu and view your notifications and it will still be there.",
